# The vendored TypeScript compiler is not in version control (see .gitignore); it is
# put in place by `tools/vendor_typescript.py` before a release build. setuptools
# builds an sdist from what is on disk, so this is what carries the compiler into the
# sdist and therefore into any wheel built from it.
recursive-include lachesis/frontends/typescript/vendor *
recursive-include lachesis/_native *
recursive-include lachesis/_atropos_catalog *

include LICENSE
include NOTICE
include tools/vendor_typescript.py
